### =========================================

### ASSIGNMENT ID

### =========================================

@assignmentId = YOUR-ASSIGNMENT-UUID

### =====================================================

### 1. IRUKA → GRADE 6 A

### =====================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/schools/{{schoolId}}/class-teacher-assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teacherId": "{{irukaId}}",
  "classId": "{{grade6AId}}",
  "academicYearId": "{{academicYearId}}"
}

### =====================================================

### 2. ASUMA → GRADE 6 B

### =====================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/schools/{{schoolId}}/class-teacher-assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teacherId": "{{asumaId}}",
  "classId": "{{grade6BId}}",
  "academicYearId": "{{academicYearId}}"
}

### =====================================================

### 3. KAKASHI → GRADE 7 B

### =====================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/schools/{{schoolId}}/class-teacher-assignments
